    "catalog:note": "Wall light, back to the wall at -z, mounted about 1.80 to its middle. The plan is the box outline with the half-circle mark inside it; the body is a box lantern, since a half cylinder does not mirror. bottom 1.68, top 1.93. The power port is 1 pole, 230 V (unverified); its amperage is left out on purpose.",
